{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 80, "timestamp": 1778683959, "idle_time_limit": 3.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-color"}, "title": "Ubuntu AI Packaging Mentor — Full Workflow Demo"}
[0.083056, "o", "\u001b[1;36m── Ubuntu AI Packaging Mentor — Live Demo ──\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.35266, "o", "\u001b[1m\r\r\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\r\n║      Ubuntu AI Packaging Mentor  (CoreDev Edition)   ║\r\r\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mSelect your experience level:\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m) Beginner\u001b[33m  — Explains the 'Why' — packaging concepts in plain language.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m) MOTU\u001b[33m  — Focuses on Ubuntu Policy and compliance.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m) CoreDev\u001b[33m  — Raw output — logs, diffs, system state. No preamble.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36mq\u001b[0m) Quit\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mEnter choice [1-3]:\u001b[0m "]
[2.774586, "o", "\u001b[32m\r\r\n✓ Persona set to: Beginner — Explains the 'Why' — packaging concepts in plain language.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mEnter path to package source directory:\u001b[0m "]
[6.845379, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1mSelect a skill:\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m) Audit\u001b[33m  — Legal/copyright analysis — produces a DEP-5 debian/copyright file.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m) Detect\u001b[33m  — Dependency discovery — resolves #include headers to Build-Depends packages.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m) Scribe\u001b[33m  — Changelog generation — summarises git log into debian/changelog format.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36m4\u001b[0m) Patch\u001b[33m  — Source patching — manages quilt patch series on upstream source.\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u001b[36mq\u001b[0m) Quit\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mEnter choice [1-4]:\u001b[0m "]
[8.46716, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[36m▶\u001b[0m \u001b[1mAudit\u001b[0m on \u001b[33mlab/sources/hello-package\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r  ⠋ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠙ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠹ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠸ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   \r  ⠼ Audit: context … (usually ~120s)   "]
