[38.55104, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[32m[Beginner]\u001b[0m Build-Depends lists every package the build system needs before it can compile your source. The Detect skill scans #include directives and autoconf macros, resolving them to Ubuntu -dev packages automatically — saving you from chasing missing headers by hand.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\r\r\nCalling Agent...\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r  ⠋ Detect: before save … (usually ~120s)   "]
