[92.997011, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[32m[Beginner]\u001b[0m debian/changelog is the official release history of your package. Each stanza records who changed what and when, and sets the version number dpkg uses. Scribe reads your git history and drafts a properly formatted entry so nothing gets lost between commits and release.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[36m\r\r\nCalling Agent...\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
